            "review_title": "Review at Ngưu Cát Wagyu Yakiniku",
            "review_text": "nhung p\n1 contribution\n0\nGood Wagyu BBQ Restaurant in Ho Chi Minh City\nMay 2025 • Friends\nNot every dish was a perfect 10, but the beef and Caesar salad were seriously delicious!\nThe staff were polite and lovely—maybe the restaurant’s still new, so a few things felt a bit unorganized, but their attitude was great so I’d still recommend it!\nThe space is unique and airy. You don’t usually get such a spacious seating arrangement at this price point!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 5, 2025",
