            "review_title": "Review at Ngưu Cát Wagyu Yakiniku",
            "review_text": "vân v\n4 contributions\n0\nBest for dinner with friends or a date! Book a VIP room for privacy, and try the omakase set—it’s the perfect way to tas\nJul 2025 • Couples\nI went for the Omakase 2 (1,590k/pax) and it was absolutely worth it. Each course was beautifully prepared, and the quality really showed. The Wagyu sirloin and short rib were unbelievably tender—melted in my mouth. I paired it with a glass of red wine, which brought out the flavor even more. A perfect match.\nI chose to sit at the counter and loved it—great view of the open grill and the chefs in action. It made the whole experience feel more personal and fun.But what really stood out was the staff. They were incredibly friendly and attentive—even the small things were noticed and taken care of. One of them quietly replaced my chopsticks when I dropped them without me even asking. So thoughtful and sweet. Their warm energy really added to the whole experience.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nPerfect for date night—ask for a cozy corner or balcony seat for a more romantic vibe.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 18, 2025",
